From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] domicile: a website frame hides what the ad blocker names

The filter lists hide ads by their elements as well as block their
requests (`##.ad`, `example.com##.promo`). ChromeContentRendererClient::
RenderFrameCreated gives every frame a domicile::CosmeticFilters, which
does nothing until the browser sends it what to hide before a
navigation commits, then puts that in the new document as a user
stylesheet and asks the browser about the document's classes and ids as
they appear. See components/domicile/renderer/cosmetic_filters.h.

Verified: not built. This repository cannot build Chromium; the engine
job builds it on `crux`.
---
 chrome/renderer/BUILD.gn                          | 1 +
 chrome/renderer/chrome_content_renderer_client.cc | 6 ++++++
 2 files changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/chrome/renderer/BUILD.gn b/chrome/renderer/BUILD.gn
index 13a30c78ff1ef..e7be1c370de43 100644
--- a/chrome/renderer/BUILD.gn
+++ b/chrome/renderer/BUILD.gn
@@ -154,6 +154,7 @@ static_library("renderer") {
     "//components/country_codes",
     "//components/crx_file",
     "//components/domicile:common",
+    "//components/domicile:cosmetic_filters",
     "//components/domicile:electron_preload",
     "//components/domicile:electron_schemes",
     "//components/facilitated_payments/content/renderer",
diff --git a/chrome/renderer/chrome_content_renderer_client.cc b/chrome/renderer/chrome_content_renderer_client.cc
index aa1ff0f041491..a6184586294a6 100644
--- a/chrome/renderer/chrome_content_renderer_client.cc
+++ b/chrome/renderer/chrome_content_renderer_client.cc
@@ -6,6 +6,7 @@
 
 #include "components/domicile/common/domicile_scheme.h"
 #include "components/domicile/common/electron_schemes.h"
+#include "components/domicile/renderer/cosmetic_filters.h"
 #include "components/domicile/renderer/electron_preload.h"
 
 #include <functional>
@@ -709,6 +710,11 @@ void ChromeContentRendererClient::RenderFrameCreated(
   // See components/domicile/renderer/electron_preload.h.
   domicile::ElectronPreload::Attach(render_frame);
 
+  // Domicile's engine fork. A website frame's cosmetic filters: the browser
+  // sends a frame what to hide before each navigation commits. See
+  // components/domicile/renderer/cosmetic_filters.h.
+  domicile::CosmeticFilters::Attach(render_frame);
+
   auto content_settings_delegate =
       std::make_unique<ChromeContentSettingsAgentDelegate>(render_frame);
 #if BUILDFLAG(ENABLE_EXTENSIONS_CORE)
-- 
2.43.0

